{"split": "train", "number": 24, "input": "得乙肝三年，肝功正常，DNA10的7次方\n我孫子得了乙肝，有了3年了，昰她媽傳然的，肝功還正常，就昰DNA病毒函量10的7次方，請問點樣治療，謝謝！", "output": "推薦診室：傳染科，因為你提到孫仔有乙肝，想了解病毒量同治療安排，可以由傳染科跟進。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/024_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 16.32, "sha256": "e07ec5b3f841813ed0dd5e9ef252eca131e7169eaca4e15f68e5e933df72f6fc", "request_id": "dd0fb23a-ae45-931c-ac04-66d0a6751954", "usage": {"characters": 128}}
{"split": "train", "number": 25, "input": "髕骨骨折術後23天點樣鍛鍊腿部肌肉\n髕骨骨折術後23天了，還是唔可以直抬腿，而家就是每日伸縮腿，高抬腿，也唔知有效還是無效，點樣才能更快鍛鍊肌肉", "output": "推薦診室：康復醫學科，因為你做完髕骨骨折手術後仲未能直抬腿，想了解肌肉訓練，可以由康復醫學科評估同安排。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/025_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 17.76, "sha256": "5cf4972bec68109822264a6f400c971d6d20d63e5ee7ed8fc7b7781da054134d", "request_id": "0b787289-0f61-9f75-ad20-b9249f07a876", "usage": {"characters": 142}}
{"split": "train", "number": 26, "input": "已經三個月的左腕舟狀骨骨折還有機會完全康\n搬貨向後摔倒，左手撐地，已經三個月了，還有冇機會完全康復，MRI檢查報告單結果:左腕舟狀骨骨折，三角骨骨折挫傷", "output": "推薦診室：康復醫學科，因為你提到手腕骨折已經三個月，想了解功能可唔可以恢復，可以由康復醫學科評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/026_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 17.28, "sha256": "cb664a7e3d6f605ca98099eb61e8f61677512fca04f699e9f6803ae22d2fee9e", "request_id": "beb931a3-b251-9f51-bee0-a7a9ee89a1b8", "usage": {"characters": 142}}
{"split": "train", "number": 27, "input": "請問韌帶拉傷幾耐能恢復，點樣治療\n我腳韌帶拉傷快兩個月了，一直在治療，目前還有啲微腫，唔可以正常走路，請問韌帶拉傷到底幾耐才能恢復", "output": "推薦診室：康復醫學科，因為你提到腳韌帶拉傷後仲有啲腫，行路未恢復正常，可以由康復醫學科評估恢復進度。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/027_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 14.32, "sha256": "5d74484420fb45404786fce42851ddcab7bfead60ddc39654c81acbb73b14751", "request_id": "4aa8722b-55f3-907a-a3f7-d5c4fd20ba02", "usage": {"characters": 124}}
{"split": "train", "number": 28, "input": "寒濕體質點樣調理？腹脹痛便溏，是寒濕嗎？\n最近腸胃不好，吃不下飯，便溏，四肢無力，腹脹痛，口乾舌燥，去睇醫生説我寒濕，是脾胃虛寒嗎？應該點樣調理？", "output": "推薦診室：中醫科，因為你提到肚脹、胃口差，同埋之前睇過中醫話有寒濕，想了解點樣調理，可以由中醫評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/028_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 16.24, "sha256": "c791ccd8491b989afa435fea334b03a837fe57896e85676c0c2d7fade82b5a04", "request_id": "f2f5df4d-de26-9977-996c-cddaa2b246c7", "usage": {"characters": 133}}
{"split": "train", "number": 29, "input": "請問一下點樣煮中藥，兩天一副的藥\n你好醫生，我想問一下點樣煮中藥，藥是兩天吃一副，一天吃三次，我白天沒時間煮，晚上下班才有時間，請問一下點樣煮才好", "output": "推薦診室：中醫科，因為你想問中藥點樣煎同點樣安排服用，可以向中醫查詢。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/029_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 15.2, "sha256": "059a9e4cf9a0ca7530d53265d1e28f814560b1e239043edc619ba45ca2d0c88b", "request_id": "02ef023b-5a68-9ff8-89bf-7ee15b44ab3b", "usage": {"characters": 138}}
{"split": "train", "number": 30, "input": "四肢冰冷怕冷，抖，麻，增加活動量無汗。\n四肢冰冷，怕冷，抖，另四肢麻。增加活動量無汗，瞓覺被窩無熱量，其他一切正常。用過一次中藥熱方不見效果。", "output": "推薦診室：中醫科，因為你提到手腳冰冷、怕凍同發麻，試過中藥但冇改善，可以由中醫再評估調理方向。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/030_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 18.08, "sha256": "934952ea15f2524f0fe2a7e5accd42141cae71c27e00c5b9083a81fa385241fd", "request_id": "6656dc02-ce1c-9223-862a-57247ea5de31", "usage": {"characters": 129}}
{"split": "train", "number": 31, "input": "點消除緊張、焦慮、恐懼心理嘅焦慮症嘅症狀表現", "output": "推薦診室：心理健康科，因為你想了解點樣紓緩緊張、焦慮同恐懼，可以搵專業人員傾吓。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/031_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 5.68, "sha256": "9ebb235cad8a066f717c0b30de2118cdffb6f51b3862b80dbd3d94ffb9406b73", "request_id": "9c31d2ab-8adb-99d7-ab49-6fc622a1d317", "usage": {"characters": 42}}
{"split": "train", "number": 32, "input": "強迫症點辦呢。特別難受。 我有強迫症，做嘢拖拖拉拉，控制唔到嘅拖拖拉拉", "output": "推薦診室：心理健康科，因為你做嘢成日拖延，覺得控制唔到又難受，可以搵專業人員評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/032_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 7.6, "sha256": "46d60f815f7b789423bdf12bd69b0016e2a343490599c101c2e69258991016ee", "request_id": "f373ec7d-3a00-952c-aa38-0a92994c6c64", "usage": {"characters": 65}}
{"split": "train", "number": 33, "input": "好像有點潔癖和強迫症。 比較乾淨，每日要洗好多次手，睇到污糟嘢想嘔噃，起雞皮疙瘩", "output": "推薦診室：心理健康科，因為你每日要洗好多次手，見到污糟嘢會想嘔同起雞皮，可以搵專業人員評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/033_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 8.24, "sha256": "6fb5ba6e7a36d3cc46880fdec238ce8f0a08395b8d37dd84c515fa7882455a45", "request_id": "dcbd74d2-4fbf-9089-8e66-4226dfd1985b", "usage": {"characters": 75}}
{"split": "train", "number": 34, "input": "不整容，點去除額頭紋？我額頭紋比較重，想知點去除額頭紋", "output": "推薦診室：整形美容科，因為你額頭紋比較深，想了解有咩改善方法，可以搵醫生評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/034_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 6.48, "sha256": "7e75116b37e66d249f06e54ce3382784f27ed1b716f9e254d712446fdbca715f", "request_id": "60c80e4f-e5fe-94ad-8284-f413bd2e8cd4", "usage": {"characters": 51}}
{"split": "train", "number": 35, "input": "臉上的疤痕點去掉？ 細個嗰陣臉上摔了了一跤，把臉摔破了，點樣才能去掉疤痕呢？", "output": "推薦診室：整形美容科，因為你細個跌傷塊面後留低疤痕，想改善外觀，可以搵醫生評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/035_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 12.08, "sha256": "28b128acb92fac5fb818e318a80bc1279450110ce09c1a67601ffaf742e52bad", "request_id": "0d971628-319f-9c3e-888a-92bacbcc6f4f", "usage": {"characters": 71}}
{"split": "train", "number": 36, "input": "塌鼻子能做假體隆鼻呀。 我嘅鼻頭係比較塌嘅種，可唔可以唔做假體？如果唔得，有冇其他方法？", "output": "推薦診室：整形美容科，因為你覺得鼻頭比較塌，想了解假體以外嘅改善方法，可以搵醫生評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/036_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 8.8, "sha256": "69205cd0d40e5f8b34a413fe2a5c5bd495e876fea7e7150c6659f69b6e442af1", "request_id": "5e6ca19a-9709-9d11-a794-438168939acd", "usage": {"characters": 82}}
