{"split": "train", "number": 38, "input": "我返工成日食外賣，想知點樣揀先均衡啲？", "output": "推薦診室：營養保健科，因為你成日食外賣，想食得均衡啲，可以搵專業人員傾吓點樣揀餐。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/038_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 3.12, "sha256": "7cd33ac55f0f6b3d8c1f31e316a3643f6fc7fd0b92d81da6a2caab8b1c9a0192", "request_id": "6393f493-97f1-914b-a62f-814db4cb0770", "usage": {"characters": 36}}
{"split": "train", "number": 39, "input": "我平時唔飲奶，想問日常飲食可以點樣補鈣？", "output": "推薦診室：營養保健科，因為你平時唔飲奶，想了解點樣從飲食攝取鈣質，可以搵專業人員傾吓。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/039_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 4.56, "sha256": "27c5c56ac06bc64949adc7bc5493dedd76cc2cdf42b6cf59dae555b46b363ce3", "request_id": "e4a89622-47cc-9e39-b2ee-70473d29e3fc", "usage": {"characters": 38}}
{"split": "train", "number": 40, "input": "氣管鏡檢查難受嗎？應做邊啲準備？", "output": "推薦診室：輔助檢查科，因為你想了解氣管鏡檢查嘅過程同事前準備，可以向輔助檢查科查詢。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/040_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 3.6, "sha256": "0a9db86953bcf4abf752f45d98621135661b1882d4022a1654c672df7063cdaf", "request_id": "05c7b4e4-fed1-910b-aab5-ffbb2b29765e", "usage": {"characters": 30}}
{"split": "train", "number": 41, "input": "磁共振檢查時噪音過大我前陣子檢查了磁共振，因為頭一次做，所以唔知噪音這麼大，進去後就受噪音的折磨，我感覺不適醫生也沒讓我出來啊，請問這應該嗎？謝謝", "output": "推薦診室：輔助檢查科，因為你想了解磁共振檢查嘅噪音，同檢查期間唔舒服可以點樣處理，可以向輔助檢查科查詢。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/041_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 17.12, "sha256": "921b9fe6f1dd350b56a3c708ccd00d31dd7d271ac1fe9fae648378c4c45931dd", "request_id": "b28a8fce-f2fe-9066-a658-10484bffd0fc", "usage": {"characters": 140}}
{"split": "train", "number": 42, "input": "招工體檢，尿常規異常，Hb2+,建議複查，憂悶我女友招工體檢，尿常規異常，Hb2+,建議複查，這是咩事,請幫助！\nHb2是咩呀，點樣網上都找不到呀？", "output": "推薦診室：輔助檢查科，因為你想了解尿液檢查報告嘅結果同覆查安排，可以向輔助檢查科查詢。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "train/042_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 20.08, "sha256": "1f9809b3923cb99f945fa12af788273f66553e870db1b48e50bb89650264aa81", "request_id": "39db26be-5300-9e73-8284-f4141f7a33c3", "usage": {"characters": 129}}
{"split": "validation", "number": 1, "input": "屁多，小肚痛，肚瀉，拉完還是疼。 最近每日都肚痛，肚瀉，拉完還是疼，唔係很疼，隱隱的疼，係點回事？", "output": "推薦診室：內科，因為你最近日日肚瀉、放屁多，屙完仲有隱隱肚痛，需要檢查腸胃。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "validation/001_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 12.4, "sha256": "802c534a2fe0a592d643a1582a10cfd0551d23f9d75c2818d2c3b0f32982b766", "request_id": "c782b202-04ec-9e0c-9a6f-32147ca20442", "usage": {"characters": 87}}
{"split": "validation", "number": 2, "input": "後腦左側長了個脂肪瘤\n我腦袋左側長了個脂肪瘤大概有一年多了有2釐米那麼大吧割掉的話能不把全部頭髮剃掉嗎？傷口會唔會很大？", "output": "推薦診室：外科，因為你提到後腦有脂肪瘤，想了解切除同傷口安排，可以向外科查詢。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "validation/002_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 13.6, "sha256": "14a52b76f947226e3ee8c35f83c110a0cb4508564a4c1e3bc3321a436c1d7550", "request_id": "216e4488-6df3-93cd-bde7-ab12dfd18429", "usage": {"characters": 117}}
{"split": "validation", "number": 3, "input": "我女兒今年以八歲多了，還尿牀，每晚兩次或\n我女兒八歲多了還尿牀，每晚兩三次，如果食咗水果或飲料，晚上尿三次以上，中醫看了，西醫看了，藥沒少吃，就是不見好", "output": "推薦診室：兒科，因為你提到八歲女兒晚晚仲有尿床，試過治療都未改善，可以由兒科跟進。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "validation/003_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 16.8, "sha256": "c53f43365e07df8f9ab04e2f01e90fe1f04e21c9fe4c885f6329494c020c2eb9", "request_id": "d684e8ba-35d0-972a-8818-1fd5dee6bd6d", "usage": {"characters": 142}}
