{"split": "test", "number": 19, "input": "中醫診脈體內嚴重虛寒？\n成日尿頻尿急，感覺憋到尿。特別怕冷，很容易疲勞。給中醫診脈，看舌頭，説是體內嚴重虛寒。請問體內虛寒是咩引起的？有咩好的中藥方劑調理？", "output": "推薦診室：中醫科，因為你提到怕凍、容易攰同尿頻，之前睇過中醫，想再問中藥調理，可以由中醫跟進。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "test/019_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 17.44, "sha256": "8d333fa11a43bd7902f14ee5897084edb737b115e1171f82dd74bf280e8cc826", "request_id": "2e6bb211-3955-9cd5-be02-e5ae28bea16e", "usage": {"characters": 145}}
{"split": "test", "number": 20, "input": "胃熱口氣大五更泄，舌苔黃白厚，有齒痕手足\n睇過中醫説是脾胃濕熱，上熱下寒飲咗三個月中藥效果不大，肝膽腎胃鏡都檢查了，正常。", "output": "推薦診室：中醫科，因為你提到口氣同腸胃問題，飲咗幾個月中藥都冇乜改善，可以由中醫再評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "test/020_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 15.68, "sha256": "ef9c18b5eb8458610588338a880161d791d346cd7e438f745422fef585ecf764", "request_id": "b472cb2e-560e-904b-a943-2427cd9bc6ee", "usage": {"characters": 115}}
{"split": "test", "number": 21, "input": "強迫症治療唔好嘅機率有幾多啊。 幾個月前查出強迫性思維，食藥，想問嚇多久能治好，有冇治療不好的可能", "output": "推薦診室：心理健康科，因為你之前查出強迫性思維，而家想了解治療進展同康復時間，可以搵醫生覆診評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "test/021_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 10.64, "sha256": "f17af8af01214493a213c1e30bd409cb300913fae6ef57c5ba1cc19e0b05c1e1", "request_id": "30cbedc3-bebd-9e0c-9295-3c39026fc0df", "usage": {"characters": 93}}
{"split": "test", "number": 22, "input": "焦慮症，抑鬱症，失眠。 醫生好，經常失眠，難入眠，淺睡眠，夢多，點樣自我治癒呢，多謝，工作早8點到晚9點", "output": "推薦診室：心理健康科，因為你經常難入睡、瞓得淺又多夢，仲提到焦慮同抑鬱困擾，可以搵專業人員評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "test/022_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 13.92, "sha256": "e870f1584145b939cc1e74ed104ac1bb2f254657e4d15cb95676c156684db652", "request_id": "efaa88c7-1ed0-9962-903a-bb9b85f8325d", "usage": {"characters": 93}}
{"split": "test", "number": 23, "input": "點去疤痕最有效最簡便。 點樣除掉面同身上嘅疤痕，大概有23個月嘅痘痘被抓亂之後留低疤，以前唔會留疤", "output": "推薦診室：整形美容科，因為你面同身上嘅痘痘抓損後留低疤痕，想了解修復方法，可以搵醫生評估。", "spoken_field": "input", "audio": "test/023_input.wav", "model": "qwen3-tts-flash", "voice": "Rocky", "language_type": "Chinese", "sample_rate": 24000, "channels": 1, "sample_width": 2, "duration_seconds": 12.72, "sha256": "3d330a4bf410c5b292f01c264b82f9e0146667600e789763828163427f23d25a", "request_id": "3c36e5ab-158e-9597-ad79-eeb0b5e9eeae", "usage": {"characters": 96}}
